================================================================================
[G] scale separation at beta=2.5: correlation length in lattice units
================================================================================
  m a = 1.880  ->  xi/a = 0.532   [strong-coupling leading 4ln(4/beta)]
  m a = 0.770  ->  xi/a = 1.299   [scaling  m/sqrt(sigma)~3.5, sqrt(sigma)a~0.22]
  both give xi/a ~ O(1): number of halving (b=2) steps = log2(xi/a) ~ 0.38.  NO RG TOWER (0-1 steps) at beta=2.5.

